			"notes": "# Release 0.0.3-1.16.2\n### The pathing update\n\n\n\n## New Features\n\n* Added drawing paths on the minimap and voxelmap screen.\n* Added config screen via modmenu\n\n## Config Options\n* closeOnPath: Whether or not the map/waypoint screen should be closed when you start pathing\n* tempWaypoints: Whether or not a temporary waypoint should be added to your waypoints if not already pathing to a waypoint\n* shouldWaypointEnable: Whether or not the temp waypoint should be visible\n* drawPathOnMinimap: Should the current baritone path be drawn on the minimap\n* drawPathOnMap: Should the current path be drawn on the VoxelMap"
		},
